# ==============================================================================
# Lethal Company Obsolete Files & Folders Deletion Manifest
# ==============================================================================
# Add relative paths (from the game root directory) of obsolete files or folders
# to remove before applying new mod patches.
#
# Rules:
# - Lines starting with '#' and empty lines are ignored.
# - Forward slashes ('/') and backslashes ('\') are both supported.
# - Spaces in paths and folder names are supported without quotes.
# - If the path points to a directory, the entire directory and its contents
#   will be removed recursively.
# - If the path points to a file, only that specific file will be deleted.
#
# Examples:

# Obsolete mod DLLs:
# BepInEx/plugins/OldDeprecatedMod.dll
# BepInEx/plugins/SomeModWith Spaces/DeprecatedHelper.dll

# Obsolete configuration files:
# BepInEx/config/deprecated_mod_settings.cfg

# Obsolete whole mod directories / asset bundles:
# BepInEx/plugins/RemovedModFolder
# BepInEx/patchers/OldPatcher.dll
